{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今晚（19日）隆重舉行，紅地氈環節於下午5時45分正式揭幕！全台逾200位藝員盛裝打扮出席，齊齊歡度TVB 59周年台慶，現場星光熠熠，氣氛相當熱烈。</p><p></p><p>今屆大會司儀陣容同樣鼎盛，由汪明荃（阿姐）領軍，聯同林溥來、朱凱婷、周奕瑋、洪永城、黃翠如、陸浩明、麥美恩、鄭衍峰、林秀怡、孔德賢及潘靜文，合共12位司儀強勢坐鎮，攜手帶領觀眾投入整晚台慶盛況。</p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4430.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026feoJicStd11795084746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4357.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BKlSht9aFV1795084742.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4386.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X0qN0Uo3po1795084745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4392.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FNTjnCUUqA1795084745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4687.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ts6DCTDio71795084752.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4699.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HPqGnyqNph1795084752.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4706.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026em2lYK7iQX1795084753.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4749.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E9Mz9G05xD1795084754.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4788.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QoHFvF2ciy1795084754.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4861.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gI8MzrpYDJ1795084755.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.002592+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.138884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.138884+00:00","content_hash":"12366a98066259c7c554c7cfe376389935f655d8a8ec2a0ed6d2f8b0e1642199","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}